  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "The red rays contain all values less than $-3,$ or greater than $1.$ In addition, \n\n- the closed circle at $-3$ implies that $x$ can be equal to $-3,$ and\n\n- the open circle at $1$ implies that $x$ cannot be equal to $1.$\n\nTherefore, the highlighted region represents $x\\le -3$ or $x>1.$",
